  {
    "q": "How high does the Mardi Himal Trek go?",
    "a": "The standard plan reaches the Lower Viewpoint at about 4,000m on Day 4. The highest overnight stop is High Camp at 3,550m. If you are strong and well acclimatised, your guide can take you higher to the Upper Viewpoint or towards Mardi Himal Base Camp."
  },
